'''Houndstone''' (Japanese: '''ハカドッグ''' ''Hakadog'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Paldean Wonders}} expansion.

