==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Scarlet & Violet|Houndstone|106}} from the {{TCG|Scarlet & Violet}} expansion.
**Both cards have the {{m|Last Respects}} attack; this is a [[move]] in the [[Pokémon games]] that {{p|Houndstone}} can learn.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Violet}}.

